  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wishful-recipes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/4xVp9RM1/wishcraft(2).png\" alt=\"此模組已併入 Wishful Recipes。點擊此處前往查看。它能自行動態生成配方，因此與其他模組具有高度相容性，且所需設定較少。 \"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kJdiggR.png\" alt=\"標題\"></p>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/2CUh6gMuCt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1027252425960198165?color=5b6ee1&label=Discord&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fmars_\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/ko--fi-donate-FF5E5B?style=for-the-badge&logo=ko-fi&logoColor=white\" alt=\"在 ko-fi 上支持我\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blasting-clay-and-clay-balls\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/956343?color=F16436&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white&label=Curseforge&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fblasting-clay-and-clay-balls\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/blasting-clay-and-clay-balls?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white&label=modrinth&color=00AF5C\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> </strong></h5>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br>此模組支援完整自訂設定，讓您在熔煉爐中燒製黏土、黏土塊和陶土的速度是普通熔爐的兩倍。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/haJFk6e.png\" alt=\"\" height=\"270\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/i7ZQEF8.png\" alt=\"\" height=\"270\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rmPI78y.png\" alt=\"\" height=\"270\"></p>\n<p><strong>設定</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>您可以在遊戲內直接設定此模組，或編輯遊戲資料夾中的 JSON 檔案 <code>config/blastingclay.json</code>。請注意，任何修改都需要重新啟動 Minecraft 才能生效。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>blasting_list</strong> - 字串列表，每個字串代表一組熔煉爐配方，指定輸入物品、輸出物品以及熔煉所獲得的經驗值。</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JNZ2GMV.png\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deimos-fabric-forge-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/83sD0W8.png\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdeimos\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/j2GIPnt.png\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://url-shortener.curseforge.com/KRMk5\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/y3LiTfU.png\"></a></p>",
